This is one of the first things people ask you in professional conversations.

209
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:18,240
Whether you're networking, meeting clients, attending meetings, or even chatting with

210
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,240
colleagues.

211
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:22,800
Yes, and many English learners feel nervous here.

212
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:28,600
